  "summary_en": "WAM news report on the UAE's new federal decree-law on traffic regulation, which updates vehicle classifications and expands the use of self-driving vehicles. A cabinet resolution will set licensing and trial rules for them. It also covers licensing, insurance liability, a Federal Traffic Council and penalties.",
